    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> you must have mastered <strong>Chimerist</strong>.</p><hr><p>Choose two creature Species among <strong>construct</strong>, <strong>demon</strong>, <strong>elemental</strong>, and <strong>undead</strong>. You can now use <strong>Spell Mimic</strong> to learn spells from creatures of the chosen Species.</p><p>This Heroic Skill <strong>may be acquired up to twice</strong>, each time selecting two Species from the list above.</p><p>Whenever you acquire this Skill, you also increase your upper limit for memorized <strong>Chimerist</strong> spells by 2.</p>",
